  "description": "Adds helpers to easily bootstrap an application using conventions by\n            just using the correct extension method. This adds command line operations, additional\n            configuration, logging and service injections by convention. One package for every host: the helpers for the generic\n            host, ASP.NET Core, .NET MAUI, Uno Platform and Blazor WebAssembly are emitted into the application when it references\n            that host's framework.",
